e  date for it and it does make sense that  it would be we should assume that tom  holland's spider-man is going to be in  avengers secret wars we should assume  that tom holland's spider-man is indeed  going to be a big part of the avengers  moving forward once they kind of form  again because right now there isn't  really an official avengers team in the  mcu but that means that marvel studios  and sony are going to need one more  spider-man film in the mcu before this  happens especially since both sony and  marvel did announce that another film  was coming it's obviously not going to  come after secret wars because too much  is going to happen and it could even  kind of reset the mcu so that movie has  to come before secret wars so this  release date is probably it and i'll  explain why but first big thank you to  mint mobile for sponsoring this video  most people know about mint mobile  because of ryan reynolds but most people  don't know about mint mobile's amazing  quality now i live in the mountains and  service isn't too good however mint  mobile sent me a free plan and i get  better service with their plan than i do  with my other provider but what's crazy  is their plan is so much cheaper mint  mobile offers wireless for just 15 bucks  a month they give you the best rate  whether you're buying for one or a  family and at mint mobile families start  at only two lines all plans come with  unlimited talk and text plus high speed  data delivered on the nation's largest  5g network plus mint mobile's modern  family plan lets you mix and match data  plans so everyone gets the amount of  data that's right for them and you can  use your own phone and keep your same  number and contacts so to get your new  wireless plan for just 15 bucks a month  including the modern family plan go to  mintmobile.com cosmic that's mint  mobile.com cosmic cut your wireless  build down to 15 bucks a month at  mintmobile.com  cosmic one of the reasons that i think  that this could be the slot for  spider-man 4 is because marvel studios  when they announce their phases phase 5  phase six phase four in the past they  never announce spider-man movies if you  take a look at when kevin feige  officially announced phase three or  phase four you won't find any spider-man  movies on there anywhere the same goes  for phase five and phase six yes they  have revealed all of phase five and they  have revealed some of phase six but  notice spider-man was not on phase five  anywhere however he wouldn't be it would  be the same as phase three and phase  four they wouldn't show spider-man but  he would be in there somewhere and like  i said since this movie has to come out  before secret wars this release date is  probably for spider-man 4 putting it  inside of phase 5 before phase 6 where  everything starts to go down the  fantastic four the king dynasty and  secret wars and if we stop and consider  some of the rumors that have been going  around recently this release date makes  even more sense if we consider the fact  that andrew garfield and toby mcguire  are probably returning for secret wars  as well there is just too much that  needs to happen in a spider-man 4 movie  for a spider-man 4 movie to take place  right before everything happens in phase  six at the end of spider-man no way home  the memory of peter parker was erased  from everybody mj ned doctor strange  happy and maybe wang she hulk made it  kind of sound like he kind of knew who  spider-man was and maybe it's just  spider-man and not peter parker we'll  have to wait and see on that but they  have to address this in spider-man 4 and  they have to clear it because obviously  we're going to have something happen  where everybody remembers who peter is  again maybe not everybody but those  people i just mentioned that are really  close to him and of course the avengers  and at the end i really hope they  address the multiverse and also of  course the other two spider-man andrew  and toby and if they are going to be  talking about the spell that erased  everybody's memory it would make sense  that they would have to talk about the  whole multiverse incident and then that  could lead into the whole loki  multiverse incident and how everything  is kind of messed up now and kang is  coming so that would be a perfect setup  leading into phase six leading into the  king dynasty and then of course into  secret wars where toby and andrew could  return so although i can't confirm it  because it's not been confirmed yet it  does seem likely that this slot could be  for spider-man 4. now in the off chance  that sony simply labeled this very  poorly stating that it was a sony marvel  universe film the only other film that i  think that it could possibly be is venom  3. this would kind of make sense because  we know that spider-man is going to be  in venom 3 tom hardy has teased that  multiple times already plus we have the  post-credits scene for venom let there  be carnage which was just a giant giant  tease and then of course the post-credit  scene for spider-man no way home showed  venom in the mcu and although it does  seem like tom hardy's venom is going to  go up against a different spider-man  that is not tom holland and vice versa  as well tom hardy's venom very well  could go up against tom holland's  spider-man it seemed like they kind of  made these two post-credit scenes  confusing on purpose and heck there is  even the possibility that we still could  see tom hardy play venom except we could  see his variant in the mcu play venom  that would be kind of weird but that is  a way around it but of course do not  rule out andrew garfield spider-man  returning to go up against tom hardy's  venom in the sony universe remember the  line from spider-man knowing home where  he said i want to fight an alien now  technically that would not be a marvel  universe movie however again like i  stated if they simply chose poor wording  for this title that's what the movie  could be so i'm guessing that this  release date is most likely for  spider-man 4 but it also could be for  venom 3. it is really close to the  thunderbolts release date but hey if you  got to get a spider-man movie in there  you got to get one in there so let me  know your thoughts about this in the  comments down below don't forget to like  the video please and of course subscribe  to stay up to date on the latest mcu and  spider-man news for live updates you can  follow me on instagram and twitter and  as always thank you all so much for  watching woof

